        "\n",
        "## Measuring Model Performance: R²\n",
        "\n",
        "The coefficient of determination, denoted $R^2$, measures how much of the variability in the outcome is explained by the model.\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "R^2\n",
        "=\n",
        "1\n",
        "-\n",
        "\\frac{\n",
        "\\sum (y_i-\\hat{y}_i)^2\n",
        "}{\n",
