        "where\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "z\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\beta_0\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\beta_1 x_1\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\cdots\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\beta_p x_p.\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "The sigmoid function transforms any real number into a probability between 0 and 1.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Interactive Sigmoid Simulator\n",
        "\n",
